://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/61-12.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/61.html\">Surah As-Saff</a> › Verse 12</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah As-Saff 61:12</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿يَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ ذُنُوبَكُمْ وَيُدْخِلْكُمْ جَنَّاتٍ تَجْرِي مِن تَحْتِهَا الْأَنْهَارُ وَمَسَاكِنَ طَيِّبَةً فِي جَنَّاتِ عَدْنٍ ذَٰلِكَ الْفَوْزُ الْعَظِيمُ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">He will forgive for you your sins and admit you to gardens beneath which rivers flow and pleasant dwellings in gardens of perpetual residence. That is the great attainment.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فبين ما فيه من دفع مفسدة الذنوب ومن حصول مصلحة الرحمة بالجنة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 20/194</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s61a12\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/61-11.html\">Previous verse (61:11)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/61-13.html\">Next verse (61:13)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a h